      "kind": "proposed",
      "page": 0,
      "text_preview": "The block diagram of the transmitter using the multiphase reduced frequency conversion architecture is shown in Fig. 1. The transmitter is composed of a 10-b digital-to-analog converter (DAC), a baseband filter with a tuning circuit, a variable-gain amplifier (VGA), a quadrature upconverter, a preamplifier, and a frequency synthesizer. The 10-b DAC receives 10-b data from the baseband modem and op ..."
