      "title": "BUILDING BLOCKS",
      "kind": "design",
      "page": 2,
      "text_preview": "In the transmitter RF parts, the upconversion mixer and the preamplifier convert and amplify the signal from the baseband block. The LNA and the quadrature mixers amplify and convert the signal for the baseband block in the receiver. Baseband blocks include quadrature paths for filtering and controlled gain in a merged manner. The digitally controllable analog front-end allows flexibility in the o ..."
    },
