      "title": "CONCLUSION",
      "kind": "conclusion",
      "page": 9,
      "text_preview": "In this paper, we presented a prototype full-CMOS transmitter and receiver based on the direct conversion architecture for use in a complete 2.0-GHz WCDMA RF system with an additional power amplifier for third-generation cellular communications. The use of external components are limited to input matching and supply decoupling for RF and ground stabilization. A multiphase reduced frequency mixer a ..."
